cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "extension-humancheck"
abstract: >-
  A jsPsych extension that collects evidence a participant is a bot or an AI agent rather than a
  person, and scores each session without blocking anyone. It records interaction traces, probes the
  browser for signs of automation, and plants a hidden honeypot field and a hidden canary
  instruction in each trial it is attached to.
